<title>USA: ACCOUNT CLOSED -- Chandler, Ariz..</title>
<headline>ACCOUNT CLOSED -- Chandler, Ariz..</headline>
<text>
<p>CITY OF CHANDLER, ARIZONA</p>
<p>RE: $9,730,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
